---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How LongevityStack earns affiliate commissions and what that does and doesn't affect." current="affiliate-disclosure" canonicalPath="/affiliate-disclosure/">
  <main class="ls-shell">
    <article style="max-width: 68ch; padding: 64px 0 96px;" class="ls-article">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600; font-size: 46px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0 0 28px;">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p>LongevityStack participates in the Amazon Associates Program and other affiliate programs (including direct hardware-manufacturer programs). When you click certain links and make a purchase, I may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
      <p>This does not change the price you pay, and it does not change the verdict given on any product — grades and recommendations are decided before an affiliate link is attached, not the other way around. Where I have not personally tested a product, the page says so explicitly and carries no purchase recommendation.</p>
      <div class="ls-pending">TODO: replace with final legal-reviewed disclosure text and the current list of affiliate programs before publishing.</div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
